+    /// THE SOLVER↔VALIDATOR AGREEMENT PROPERTY (2026-11-11 laptop defect).
+    ///
+    /// create_coinstake must derive the kernel EXACTLY as
+    /// check_proof_of_stake does: the containing-block time comes from the
